title: No Cook Yogurt Parfait
method: raw
source: https://health.clevelandclinic.org/recipe-fruit-and-yogurt-parfaits-infographic
protein: none
ingredient_count: 6
---

Layer @plain, nonfat Greek yogurt{1/2%cup} in the bottom of the #parfait glass{}. Top with @blueberries{1/4%cup}(rinsed), @fresh strawberries{1/4%cup}(rinsed and sliced), @granola{1/8%cup} and @honey{1/2%teaspoon}.

Add a second layer of @plain, nonfat Greek yogurt{1/2%cup}, topped with @jarred cherries{1/4%cup}, another @granola{1/8%cup}, and @honey{1/2%teaspoon}.

Repeat for the remaining 2 parfaits.